## Problem classes

### `Copy during authoring`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Edits in the Superplan repo do not show up in `/grill-me` | Install used `--copy` (or npx `--copy`) | Reinstall as symlink; default `install.sh` to symlink |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Installer wiped a foreign skill`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Unrelated skill directory gone after install | `rm -rf` on a dest name collision | Only replace dest if it is a Superplan symlink (readlink equals pack `skills/<name>`) or a previous Superplan copy (`.superplan-install` marker). Preflight all dests; otherwise stop and ask |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Uninstall deleted a foreign skill`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `humanize` (or another skill) gone after removing Superplan | Uninstall used `rm -rf ~/.claude/skills` | Remove only Superplan dest names that are our symlinks or `.superplan-install` copies |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Tilde ignores fake HOME`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Tests install into the real home, or a faked `HOME` stays empty | Script used `~/.claude` / `~/.cursor` / `~/.config/opencode` (passwd home), not `$HOME` | Use `"$HOME/.claude/skills"`, `"$HOME/.cursor/skills"`, and `"$HOME/.config/opencode/skills"` everywhere |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `OpenCode dest is XDG config, not ~/.opencode`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| DeepSeek/OpenCode session has no `/grill-me` | Installed to `~/.opencode/skills` or assumed Claude dest is enough | Native dest is `$HOME/.config/opencode/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. `deepseek` is an alias for `opencode`. OpenCode can also see Claude's dest, but still install the native path when the user asks for OpenCode |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->
